/* ── ELEMENT SPEC ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   space-fill C        → SphereGeometry(0.70)  MeshPhong #4A4A4A
   space-fill H x4     → SphereGeometry(0.62)  MeshPhong #E6E3DA (interpenetrate)
   ball C              → SphereGeometry(0.35)  MeshPhong #3F4448
   ball H x4           → SphereGeometry(0.25)  MeshPhong #DCDAD3 (one tinted = highlighted)
   bond rods x4        → CylinderGeometry(0.07,0.07,1) MeshPhong #AFC3D4
   struct bond lines   → thin PlaneGeometry quads, black, gap at glyphs
   struct wedge        → ShapeGeometry quad (narrow at C, wide at H), black
